    "text": "You turned up. That is the hard part.\n\nYour first 30 days · Hackney\n\nThirty days. Done.\n\nWhatever the numbers say, you did the difficult bit: you kept turning up. Most people never get past the first week.\n\nHave a look at your InBody comparison with your coach — a month is long enough for the numbers to have moved, and it is a good deal more satisfying than guessing.\n\nWhatever you decide about carrying on, thank you for giving it a proper go. It has been a pleasure having you in.\n\nCarry on with a membership\n\nTalk it through with us\n\nSpeak soon,\n\nNick\n\nBlueprint Fitness Hackney\n\nYour studio\n\nBlueprint Fitness Hackney\n\nArch 195, Morning Lane, Hackney, London, E9 6LJ\n\nMon–Fri 6am–9pm · Sat 8–11am · Closed Sunday\n\nhackney@blueprintfitnessldn.com\n·\nWhatsApp\n\nYou are getting this because you are on the list at\nblueprintfitnessldn.com.\n\nUnsubscribe ·\n© {{right_now.year}} Blueprint Fitness",
    "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\">\n<title>Thirty days. Done.</title>\n<!-- outlook-fixes-applied --></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#EAF1FB;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0\">You turned up. That is the hard part.</div>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#EAF1FB\">\n <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:28px 0\">\n  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden\">\n\n   <tr><td style=\"background:#101B2F;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.05) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,.05) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:32px 32px;padding:26px 32px\">\n     <!-- the stacked white lockup, which is the one on the studio membership\n          cards; the blue horizontal version was a different mark and read as a\n          thin outline against this header -->\n     <img src=\"https://blueprintfitnessldn.com/img/logo-bf-stacked-white.png\" width=\"150\" alt=\"Blueprint Fitness\"\n          style=\"display:block;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;width:150px;max-width:150px;height:auto\">\n   </td></tr>\n\n   <tr><td style=\"padding:34px 32px 0\">\n     <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0072F5\">Your first 30 days &middot; Hackney</p>\n     <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:30px;line-height:1.15;font-weight:800;color:#101B2F\">Thirty days. Done.</h1>\n   </td></tr>\n\n   <tr><td style=\"padding:0 32px\">\n     <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#3D4A63\">Whatever the numbers say, you did the difficult bit: you kept turning up. Most people never get past the first week.</p>\n     <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#3D4A63\">Have a look at your InBody comparison with your coach — a month is long enough for the numbers to have moved, and it is a good deal more satisfying than guessing.</p>\n     <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#3D4A63\">Whatever you decide about carrying on, thank you for giving it a proper go. It has been a pleasure having you in.</p>\n     <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"margin:6px 0 4px\">\n     <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"background:#0072F5;border-radius:9px\">\n       <a href=\"https://blueprintfitnessldn.com/memberships/hackney/\" style=\"display:block;padding:15px 24px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none\">Carry on with a membership</a>\n     </td></tr>\n   </table>\n     <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"margin:10px 0 4px\">\n     <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"border:1.5px solid #0072F5;border-radius:9px\">\n       <a href=\"https://wa.me/447944690356?text=Hi%20Blueprint%20Fitness%20Hackney%20%E2%80%94%20I've%20finished%20my%2030%20days%20and%20wanted%20to%20chat%20about%20what's%20next.\" style=\"display:block;padding:13px 24px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#0072F5;text-decoration:none\">Talk it through with us</a>\n     </td></tr>\n   </table>\n   </td></tr>\n\n   <tr><td style=\"padding:26px 32px 0\">\n     <p style=\"margin:0 0 3px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#3D4A63\">Speak soon,</p>\n     <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#101B2F\">Nick</p>\n     <p style=\"margin:2px 0 0;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#3D4A63\">Blueprint Fitness Hackney</p>\n   </td></tr>\n\n   <tr><td style=\"padding:26px 32px 0\"><div style=\"height:1px;background:#EAF1FB;line-height:1px\">&nbsp;</div></td></tr>\n\n   <tr><td style=\"padding:20px 32px 32px\">\n     <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0072F5\">Your studio</p>\n     <p style=\"margin:0 0 3px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#101B2F\">Blueprint Fitness Hackney</p>\n     <p style=\"margin:0 0 3px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#3D4A63\">Arch 195, Morning Lane, Hackney, London, E9 6LJ</p>\n     <p style=\"margin:0 0 3px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#3D4A63\">Mon–Fri 6am–9pm · Sat 8–11am · Closed Sunday</p>\n     <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6\">\n       <a href=\"mailto:hackney@blueprintfitnessldn.com\" style=\"color:#0072F5;text-decoration:none; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: #0072F5;\"><!--[if mso]><font color=\"#0072F5\"><![endif]-->hackney@blueprintfitnessldn.com<!--[if mso]></font><![endif]--></a>\n       &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;\n       <a href=\"https://wa.me/447944690356\" style=\"color:#0072F5;text-decoration:none; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: #0072F5;\"><!--[if mso]><font color=\"#0072F5\"><![endif]-->WhatsApp<!--[if mso]></font><![endif]--></a>\n     </p>\n   </td></tr>\n\n  </table>\n\n  <p style=\"margin:16px auto 0;max-width:600px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#3D4A63;text-align:center\">\n    You are getting this because you are on the list at\n    <a href=\"https://blueprintfitnessldn.com\" style=\"color:#0072F5;text-decoration:none; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: #0072F5;\"><!--[if mso]><font color=\"#0072F5\"><![endif]-->blueprintfitnessldn.com<!--[if mso]></font><![endif]--></a>.<br>\n    <a href=\"{{trigger_link.unsubscribe}}\" style=\"color:#3D4A63; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: #3D4A63;\"><!--[if mso]><font color=\"#3D4A63\"><![endif]-->Unsubscribe<!--[if mso]></font><![endif]--></a> &middot;\n    &copy; {{right_now.year}} Blueprint Fitness\n  </p>\n\n </td></tr>\n</table>\n</body></html>",
