    "text": "The thing we hear more than anything else.\n\nIntroduction · Hackney\n\nThe thing we hear most\n\n{{contact.first_name}}, we hear one phrase more than any other: I wish I had done this years ago.\n\nMark said exactly that a few weeks in. What he told us:\n\n“Before I joined I had not exercised properly in years. I had tried gyms and always felt lost, then quit after a month. This was completely different — the coaches knew my name, showed me what to do, and made me feel like I belonged from day one.\n\nI am stronger now than I was in my thirties. I sleep better. My back pain has basically gone. And I actually look forward to going, which I never thought I would say about exercise.”\n\nThat is not an unusual story here. The difference is the environment, the coaching, and a programme built for real people rather than fitness fanatics.\n\nIf you have been putting it off, Mark's advice was simply: just start.\n\nHave a look at the 30 days\n\nSpeak soon,\n\n{{custom_values.staff_leads}}\n\nBlueprint Fitness Hackney\n\nYour studio\n\nBlueprint Fitness Hackney\n\nArch 195, Morning Lane, Hackney, London, E9 6LJ\n\nMon–Fri 6am–9pm · Sat 8–11am · Closed Sunday\n\nhackney@blueprintfitnessldn.com\n·\nWhatsApp\n\nYou are getting this because you are on the list at\nblueprintfitnessldn.com.\n\nUnsubscribe ·\n© {{right_now.year}} Blueprint Fitness",
