    "missing": false,
    "text": "Confirming what happens next.\n\nMembership · Leytonstone\n\nRequest received\n\nHello {{contact.first_name}} — this is just to confirm we have received your cancellation request.\n\nWe will be in touch to confirm your final payment date and amount, and your membership end date. Nothing else is needed from you in the meantime.\n\nYour notice period is 30 days, so you can keep training right up to your end date. Do use it.\n\nWe will be sorry to see you go. If something specific prompted it — a time that stopped working, a niggle, the cost — do tell us. We would genuinely rather know.\n\nTell us what prompted it\n\nAnd if you change your mind before the end date, just say and we will stop it.\n\nSpeak soon,\n\nThe team\n\nBlueprint Fitness Leytonstone\n\nYour studio\n\nBlueprint Fitness Leytonstone\n\nUnit 3, Hitchcock Business Centre, Leytonstone, E11 4RE\n\nOpen early ’til late, 7 days a week\n\nleytonstone@blueprintfitnessldn.com\n·\nWhatsApp\n\nYou are getting this because you are on the list at\nblueprintfitnessldn.com.\n\nUnsubscribe ·\n© {{right_now.year}} Blueprint Fitness",
