    "missing": false,
    "text": "The five sessions are still there if you want them.\n\nFrom the team · Leytonstone\n\nThree months on\n\nHello {{contact.first_name}}. It has been about three months since you finished with us, so this is just a quick one to check you are still looking after yourself.\n\nNo pitch. But the offer of five free sessions has not gone anywhere, if you are ready to get moving again.\n\nStarting again is far easier than starting. You already know how the sessions work, and the coaches already know you.\n\nHave a chat with us\n\nOr just have a look at what is running now — quite a lot has changed.\n\nSee the current timetable\n\nSpeak soon,\n\nStu\n\nBlueprint Fitness Leytonstone\n\nYour studio\n\nBlueprint Fitness Leytonstone\n\nUnit 3, Hitchcock Business Centre, Leytonstone, E11 4RE\n\nOpen early ’til late, 7 days a week\n\nleytonstone@blueprintfitnessldn.com\n·\nWhatsApp\n\nYou are getting this because you are on the list at\nblueprintfitnessldn.com.\n\nUnsubscribe ·\n© {{right_now.year}} Blueprint Fitness",
