    "missing": false,
    "text": "Michelle and Georgia both began on a 30-day trial.\n\nThe 30-Day Kickstart · South Woodford\n\nThey started on the same 30 days\n\nHello {{contact.first_name}} — the most useful thing we can show you is not us talking about ourselves. It is members talking about the bit before they started.\n\nMichelle and Georgia both began on a 30-day trial, both having not trained properly in years, and both stayed. Their stories are on the site, in their own words.\n\nWatch the member stories\n\nEvery one of them is unremarkable in the best way: someone busy, a bit apprehensive, who booked a session and then booked another one.\n\nStart your own 30 days\n\nSpeak soon,\n\nStu\n\nBlueprint Fitness South Woodford\n\nYour studio\n\nBlueprint Fitness South Woodford\n\n4 Raven Road, South Woodford, London, E18 1HB\n\nOpen 6am–9pm, every day\n\nsouthwoodford@blueprintfitnessldn.com\n·\nWhatsApp\n\nYou are getting this because you are on the list at\nblueprintfitnessldn.com.\n\nUnsubscribe ·\n© {{right_now.year}} Blueprint Fitness",
    "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\">\n<title>They started on the same 30 days</title>\n<!-- outlook-fixes-applied --></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#EAF1FB;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0\">Michelle and Georgia both began on a 30-day trial.</div>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#EAF1FB\">\n <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:28px 0\">\n  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden\">\n\n   <tr><td style=\"background:#101B2F;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.05) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,.05) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:32px 32px;padding:26px 32px\">\n     <!-- the stacked white lockup, which is the one on the studio membership\n          cards; the blue horizontal version was a different mark and read as a\n          thin outline against this header -->\n     <img src=\"https://blueprintfitnessldn.com/img/logo-bf-stacked-white.png\" width=\"150\" alt=\"Blueprint Fitness\"\n          style=\"display:block;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;width:150px;max-width:150px;height:auto\">\n   </td></tr>\n\n   <tr><td style=\"padding:34px 32px 0\">\n     <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0072F5\">The 30-Day Kickstart &middot; South Woodford</p>\n     <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:30px;line-height:1.15;font-weight:800;color:#101B2F\">They started on the same 30 days</h1>\n   </td></tr>\n\n   <tr><td style=\"padding:0 32px\">\n     <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#3D4A63\">Hello {{contact.first_name}} — the most useful thing we can show you is not us talking about ourselves. It is members talking about the bit before they started.</p>\n     <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#3D4A63\">Michelle and Georgia both began on a 30-day trial, both having not trained properly in years, and both stayed. Their stories are on the site, in their own words.</p>\n     <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"margin:6px 0 4px\">\n     <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"background:#0072F5;border-radius:9px\">\n       <a href=\"https://blueprintfitnessldn.com/#member-stories\" style=\"display:block;padding:15px 24px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none\">Watch the member stories</a>\n     </td></tr>\n   </table>\n     <div style=\"height:1px;background:#EAF1FB;line-height:1px;margin:24px 0\">&nbsp;</div>\n     <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#3D4A63\">Every one of them is unremarkable in the best way: someone busy, a bit apprehensive, who booked a session and then booked another one.</p>\n     <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"margin:10px 0 4px\">\n     <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"border:1.5px solid #0072F5;border-radius:9px\">\n       <a href=\"https://blueprintfitnessldn.com/signup-southwoodford/\" style=\"display:block;padding:13px 24px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#0072F5;text-decoration:none\">Start your own 30 days</a>\n     </td></tr>\n   </table>\n   </td></tr>\n\n   <tr><td style=\"padding:26px 32px 0\">\n     <p style=\"margin:0 0 3px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#3D4A63\">Speak soon,</p>\n     <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#101B2F\">Stu</p>\n     <p style=\"margin:2px 0 0;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#3D4A63\">Blueprint Fitness South Woodford</p>\n   </td></tr>\n\n   <tr><td style=\"padding:26px 32px 0\"><div style=\"height:1px;background:#EAF1FB;line-height:1px\">&nbsp;</div></td></tr>\n\n   <tr><td style=\"padding:20px 32px 32px\">\n     <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0072F5\">Your studio</p>\n     <p style=\"margin:0 0 3px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#101B2F\">Blueprint Fitness South Woodford</p>\n     <p style=\"margin:0 0 3px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#3D4A63\">4 Raven Road, South Woodford, London, E18 1HB</p>\n     <p style=\"margin:0 0 3px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#3D4A63\">Open 6am–9pm, every day</p>\n     <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6\">\n       <a href=\"mailto:southwoodford@blueprintfitnessldn.com\" style=\"color:#0072F5;text-decoration:none; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: #0072F5;\"><!--[if mso]><font color=\"#0072F5\"><![endif]-->southwoodford@blueprintfitnessldn.com<!--[if mso]></font><![endif]--></a>\n       &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;\n       <a href=\"https://wa.me/447538298457\" style=\"color:#0072F5;text-decoration:none; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: #0072F5;\"><!--[if mso]><font color=\"#0072F5\"><![endif]-->WhatsApp<!--[if mso]></font><![endif]--></a>\n     </p>\n   </td></tr>\n\n  </table>\n\n  <p style=\"margin:16px auto 0;max-width:600px;font-family:Inter,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#3D4A63;text-align:center\">\n    You are getting this because you are on the list at\n    <a href=\"https://blueprintfitnessldn.com\" style=\"color:#0072F5;text-decoration:none; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: #0072F5;\"><!--[if mso]><font color=\"#0072F5\"><![endif]-->blueprintfitnessldn.com<!--[if mso]></font><![endif]--></a>.<br>\n    <a href=\"{{trigger_link.unsubscribe}}\" style=\"color:#3D4A63; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: #3D4A63;\"><!--[if mso]><font color=\"#3D4A63\"><![endif]-->Unsubscribe<!--[if mso]></font><![endif]--></a> &middot;\n    &copy; {{right_now.year}} Blueprint Fitness\n  </p>\n\n </td></tr>\n</table>\n</body></html>",
